      "rationale": "DispatchPro focused on HVAC/Plumbing field service dispatch \u2014 a primary vertical for Cadence. The product category (field service dispatch SaaS for SMB trades) is identical to Cadence's positioning. DispatchPro is written off, so no active conflict, but the prior failure in this exact vertical is relevant context for the IC discussion."
    },
