      "rationale": "CrewHQ addresses contractor workforce management for SMB service businesses \u2014 overlapping with Cadence's crew management and job assignment features. Both serve the same SMB contractor customer base. Cadence's scheduling and dispatch capabilities extend into crew management territory, creating potential product overlap and shared customer confusion."
    },
    {
      "company": "SmallBizOS",
      "type": "adjacent",
      "severity": "manageable",
      "rationale": "SmallBizOS positions as an SMB operating system, potentially including or adjacent to scheduling and workforce tools. Cadence targets the same SMB customer segment. If SmallBizOS expands into field service workflows, the customer overlap and product adjacency would intensify. Currently manageable but worth monitoring."
